{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01S5", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$g : X \\to Y$", "MATH_0002": "$S$", "MATH_0003": "$X$", "MATH_0004": "$S$", "MATH_0005": "$\\Delta : Y \\to Y \\times_S Y$", "MATH_0006": "$g$", "MATH_0007": "$X$", "MATH_0008": "$S$", "MATH_0009": "$Y$", "MATH_0010": "$S$", "MATH_0011": "$g$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\item", "STRUCT_0006": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-affine-permanence}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:eefaa9eee7cec0a5e0d910e8934570234eb8763a5bdfff19d77fb528be183bd4", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8150c932923de5fe8fc9d83902c9e952988d608a25cf64495a219d83e7d07ac6", "source_text": "Suppose <MATH_0001> is a morphism of schemes over <MATH_0002>.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> If <MATH_0003> is affine over <MATH_0004> and <MATH_0005> is affine,\nthen <MATH_0006> is affine.\n<STRUCT_0003> If <MATH_0007> is affine over <MATH_0008> and <MATH_0009> is separated over <MATH_0010>,\nthen <MATH_0011> is affine.\n<STRUCT_0004> A morphism from an affine scheme to a scheme with affine\ndiagonal is affine.\n<STRUCT_0005> A morphism from an affine scheme to a separated scheme is affine.\n<STRUCT_0006>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:5acbb6b1907c5648ee0bdb0cf8b080109855cb7a990e28268970753c0ce1a16f", "unit_id": "tag:01SG:statement"}
